{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Blink bundle feels like a useful next step because I have used a basic door and window alarm and recently added Alexa devices; connected cameras would add a new capability.",
    "The Anker hub fits my history of using card readers and computer accessories because it combines connections I use, provided my computer supports its USB-C connection."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The internal SSDs and four-bay enclosure assume a computer upgrade or storage project I do not currently have; my external drive purchases do not imply I need internal components or separate drives.",
    "Another Fire TV Stick, Echo speaker, or keyboard feels less useful after my recent purchases, while AirPods address a listening need I have not expressed."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My storage purchases seem to have been treated as interest in any storage hardware, although installation requirements and immediate purpose matter to me.",
    "My interest in Alexa devices and Logitech peripherals seems to have been treated as a reason to buy more similar products even when I already have the function covered."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent Fire TV Stick 4K Max, Echo devices, and Macally keyboard make replacements less timely; accessories or added capabilities would be more useful now.",
    "Specific fit matters: I recently chose a full-size keyboard with a numeric keypad, and I would need to confirm USB-C compatibility before choosing the hub."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my interest in connected home devices and practical computer accessories, but miss whether an item adds a useful capability or duplicates something I recently bought."
}"}
